        <activityName xml:lang="en">Single room ventilator with heat recovery window frame model</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Single room ventilator with heat recovery window frame model
Production of a single room ventilator with heat recovery;
UUID: 4073875c-2a4c-3d03-bd93-1efa6d4c9172
Materials used for the production. Energy use for some production steps. Transport of raw materials to the plant.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Technology, materials and components used for a single room ventilation unit built in a window opening; including wooden cover panels, therefore higher weight than a sole single room ventilation unit
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Some process information partly from 2007
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer informations and literature data. Data of only one product on market analysed. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4073875c-2a4c-3d03-bd93-1efa6d4c9172.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
